msgid ""
"%(student)s is booked on %(name)s, charged %(price).2f on %(order)s."
msgstr ""
"%(student)s està reservada a %(name)s, amb un càrrec de %(price).2f a "
"%(order)s."

#. module: fitness_packages
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/fitness_packages/models/fitness_add_student_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(name)s' is a group class, and there is no group class to charge a "
"single booking against - the single-class packs are not on sale. Use the "
"Gift one spot to a student button to give it, or sell the student a pack "
"and let them book it."
msgstr ""
"'%(name)s' és una classe de grup i no hi ha cap classe de grup contra la "
"qual cobrar una reserva individual: els bons de classe solta no estan a "
"la venda. Fes servir el botó Regalar una plaça a una alumna per donar-la, "
"o ven-li un bo a l’alumna i deixa que reservi."

#. module: fitness_packages
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/fitness_packages/models/fitness_add_student_wizard.py:0
