msgid ""
"There is no private class product for this discipline, so there is "
"nothing to book the class against."
msgstr ""
"No hi ha cap producte de classe privada per a aquesta disciplina, així "
"que no hi ha res contra el qual reservar la classe."

#. module: fitness_packages
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:fitness_packages.field_fitness_add_student_wizard__price
msgid ""
"What the studio agreed with the student. Defaults to the list price of "
"the private class, and is meant to be changed when the conversation "
"landed somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"El que l’estudi va acordar amb l’alumna. Per defecte és el preu de tarifa "
"de la classe privada, i està pensat per canviar-se quan la conversa va "
"acabar en un altre lloc."
